      "content": "Hey, I'm working on these new training modules for our customer success team. I've got a bunch of raw call transcripts that are a bit messy and need to be cleaned up into formal, professional business English so they look good in the manual. Can you help me rewrite this snippet to make it sound more polished and appropriate for a corporate setting?\n\nTranscript snippet:\n\"Yo, i been callin bout this charge for like three days now and nobody helping me. I'm tryna get my money back but y'all keep trippin and tellin me to wait. It ain't right, man. I need this sorted out ASAP.\"",
